# Repo-level files. These live in the dotfiles repo but must never be
# installed into $HOME.
#
# Patterns match with doublestar against the TARGET path and are anchored at
# the destination root -- this is NOT gitignore semantics. So `README.md` here
# means ~/README.md only; it does not affect ~/.config/nvim/docs/keymaps.md.
#
# Source entries beginning with "." (.github/, .gitignore) are ignored by
# chezmoi automatically and need no entry here.
README.md
CLAUDE.md
Brewfile
